# Flaky tests are quarantined here.
#
# playwright.config.ts has `exclude: /quarantine\//`, so any spec file placed
# in this directory is excluded from ALL Playwright runs (including the weekly
# flaky-detection CI job and `npm run test:flaky`).
#
# Workflow:
#   1. The flaky-detection CI job (runs weekly on Sun 02:00 UTC, or via
#      manual `workflow_dispatch`) reports tests that fail intermittently.
#   2. Move the offending spec from e2e/<name>.spec.ts to
#      e2e/quarantine/<name>.spec.ts so it stops blocking PRs.
#   3. Investigate root cause and fix.
#   4. Move the file back out to e2e/ to re-enable it.
